== 3. Validation Procedures

=== 3.1 Automated Testing

'''Test Suite: Template Validator'''

```python
# Pseudo-code for template validation
def validate_template(template_path):
    results = {
        'semantic_integrity': check_smw_properties(template_path),
        'epistemic_transparency': check_epistemic_markers(template_path),
        'transclusion_hygiene': check_noinclude_blocks(template_path),
        'recursive_compatibility': check_nested_calls(template_path)
    }
    return results

def check_smw_properties(path):
    content = read_file(path)
    # Check for [[Has ...::...]] patterns
    property_sets = re.findall(r'\[\[Has \w+::', content)
    # Check for {{#set:...}}
    set_calls = re.findall(r'\{\{#set:', content)
    return len(property_sets) + len(set_calls) > 0
```

'''Command Line Validation:'''
```bash
# Check all templates for SMW property setting
find . -name "*.wiki" -exec grep -l "{{#set:" {} \;

# Check for missing noinclude blocks
find . -name "*.wiki" -exec sh -c 'grep -L "<noinclude>" "$1"' _ {} \;

# Check for epistemic markers
find . -name "*.wiki" -exec grep -l "EpistemicIcon\|epistemic" {} \;
```

=== 3.2 Manual Review

'''Review Checklist per Template:'''

| Aspect | Reviewer | Status |
|--------|----------|--------|
| Purpose clarity | Content reviewer | ☐ |
| SMW integration | Technical reviewer | ☐ |
| Epistemic marking | Epistemic reviewer | ☐ |
| Documentation | Documentation reviewer | ☐ |
| Mobile rendering | UX reviewer | ☐ |

'''Review Questions:'''
# Does this template have a clear, single purpose?
# Does every output have epistemic marking?
# Are all SMW properties correctly typed?
# Is the documentation sufficient for new users?
# Does it work on mobile devices?
# Does it handle edge cases gracefully?

=== 3.3 Integration Testing

'''Test Scenarios:'''

# '''Template Chain:''' `{{A|{{B|{{C}}}}}` - Nested template resolution
# '''Query in Template:''' `{{Infobox|query={{#ask:...}}}}` - Dynamic content
# '''Epistemic Cascade:''' Parent template inherits child epistemic status
# '''Error Propagation:''' Missing parameter handling across template chain

----
== 4. Common Failure Modes

=== 4.1 Silent Property Failure

'''Symptom:''' Template renders but properties not set
'''Cause:''' `[[Has property::value]]` inside conditional that evaluates false
'''Fix:''' Ensure property setting outside conditionals or use `{{#set:...}}`

=== 4.2 Category Pollution ===

'''Symptom:''' Template pages appear in content categories
'''Cause:''' `[[Category:...]]` outside `<noinclude>`
'''Fix:''' Move all categories inside `<noinclude>` blocks

=== 4.3 Epistemic Opacity ===

'''Symptom:''' Content displays without confidence indicators
'''Cause:''' Hardcoded epistemic status or missing marker template
'''Fix:''' Mandatory `{{EpistemicIcon|...}}` in all output templates

=== 4.4 Parser Function Conflicts ===

'''Symptom:''' `{{#ask:...}}` returns error inside template
'''Cause:''' Parser function nesting depth exceeded
'''Fix:''' Simplify template logic or use `{{#vardefine:...}}` for intermediate results

